(4,'Privicy Policy','privicy-policy','2025-01-04 14:15:17','2026-03-28 04:27:12','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;title&gt;Privacy Policy - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;body style=\"<br/>\nbackground-color:#0a0a0a;<br/>\nmargin:0;<br/>\npadding:30px;<br/>\nfont-family:\'Courier New\',monospace;<br/>\ncolor:#e8e8e8;<br/>\ndisplay:flex;<br/>\njustify-content:center;<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nmax-width:900px;<br/>\nwidth:100%;<br/>\nbackground:rgba(25,25,25,0.95);<br/>\nborder:2px solid #00ffff;<br/>\npadding:35px;<br/>\nbox-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(0,255,255,0.25);<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;header style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #00ffff;padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:25px;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h1 style=\"<br/>\nmargin:0;<br/>\nfont-size:32px;<br/>\ncolor:#00ffff;<br/>\ntext-transform:uppercase;<br/>\nletter-spacing:3px;<br/>\ntext-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.5);<br/>\n\"&gt;<br/>\nPrivacy Policy for Harley\'s Clan Forum<br/>\n&lt;/h1&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;strong&gt;Effective Date:&lt;/strong&gt; 1/1/2025<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/header&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;main style=\"line-height:1.7;font-size:15px;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nAt Harley\'s Clan Forum, accessible from<br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.com/\">https://forum.harleytg.com/</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed #00ffff;\"&gt;<br/>\n<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/\">https://forum.harleytg.online/</URL><br/>\n&lt;/a&gt;,<br/>\nwe are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and share your information, including information collected through Discord, Google, and our own system logins/signups.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;1. Information We Collect&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;When you use Harley\'s Clan Forum, we may collect the following types of information:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Information:&lt;/strong&gt; When logging in using Discord, Google, or our system we collect details such as username, user ID, avatar, email address, and information provided during signup or login.&lt;/li&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Information:&lt;/strong&gt; If additional information is submitted while using our services (such as feedback or support requests) we may collect that data.&lt;/li&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Usage Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Information about your interactions with our services including logins, theme preferences, and feature usage.&lt;/li&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IP Addresses and Device History:&lt;/strong&gt; We collect IP addresses and device history for security and monitoring purposes. IP records may be terminated at any time. You may request deletion through a support request.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;2. How We Use Your Information&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;We use your information for purposes including:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Authenticating and providing account access&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Improving and personalizing user experience&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Notifying users about updates and service changes&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Monitoring usage and preventing technical issues&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Responding to support requests and feedback&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;3. Signup and Login Options&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;We offer several login methods:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord:&lt;/strong&gt; Quick access using Discord credentials.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Password-Based:&lt;/strong&gt; Traditional account registration with password.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passwordless:&lt;/strong&gt; Login using a secure time-sensitive email link.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nDepending on the chosen method we may store authentication data such as Discord ID, Google ID, email address, or password to maintain account access and security.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;4. Sharing Your Information&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;5. Data Retention&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nWe retain personal information only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy, including legal and regulatory requirements.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;6. Your Rights&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;Depending on your location you may have rights regarding your personal data including:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Access to your personal data&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Correction of inaccurate data&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Deletion of personal data&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Restriction of data processing&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Data portability&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;7. Security of Your Information&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nWe implement reasonable security measures to protect personal data from unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;8. Changes to This Privacy Policy&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nWe may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Updates will be posted on this page and users are encouraged to review it regularly.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;9. Contact Us&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7\">https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Harley\'s Clan Forum Discord Server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/\">https://forum.harleytg.online/</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Harley\'s Clan Forum Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/p/10-help-document\">https://forum.harleytg.online/p/10-help-document</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Help Document&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/main&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(5,'Terms of Service','terms-of-service','2025-01-04 14:19:20','2026-04-09 23:00:45','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;title&gt;Terms of Service - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;body style=\"<br/>\nbackground-color:#0a0a0a;<br/>\nmargin:0;<br/>\npadding:30px;<br/>\nfont-family:\'Courier New\',monospace;<br/>\ncolor:#e8e8e8;<br/>\ndisplay:flex;<br/>\njustify-content:center;<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nmax-width:900px;<br/>\nwidth:100%;<br/>\nbackground:rgba(25,25,25,0.95);<br/>\nborder:2px solid #00ffff;<br/>\npadding:35px;<br/>\nbox-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(0,255,255,0.25);<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;header style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #00ffff;padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:25px;\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h1 style=\"<br/>\nmargin:0;<br/>\nfont-size:32px;<br/>\ncolor:#00ffff;<br/>\ntext-transform:uppercase;<br/>\nletter-spacing:3px;<br/>\ntext-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.5);<br/>\n\"&gt;<br/>\nTerms of Service for Harley\'s Clan Forum<br/>\n&lt;/h1&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;strong&gt;Effective Date/Updated:&lt;/strong&gt; 1/1/2025<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/header&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;main style=\"line-height:1.7;font-size:15px;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nWelcome to Harley\'s Clan Forum! These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") govern your use of our services. By using Harley\'s Clan Forum, you agree to comply with these Terms. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you must not use our services.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;1. Acceptance of Terms&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nBy using Harley\'s Clan Forum, you confirm that you are at least 13 years old or that you have the consent of a parent or guardian. If you are under the age of 18, you may be required to provide proof of parental consent or guardian approval to use the forum.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nID verification may be requested on a case-by-case basis depending on certain circumstances such as suspicious activity or compliance with legal requirements. Please visit the following page to complete this verification if needed:<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.com/p/21-underage-id%20verify\">https://forum.harleytg.com/p/21-underage-id%20verify</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px dashed #00ffff;\"&gt;<br/>\nParental Consent and ID Verification<br/>\n&lt;/a&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;2. User Accounts&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;To use certain features of Harley\'s Clan Forum, you may need to connect your account using one of the following methods:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord:&lt;/strong&gt; Use your Discord credentials for quick access.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Password-Based:&lt;/strong&gt; Set up a secure password during registration.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passwordless:&lt;/strong&gt; Verify login via a time-sensitive link sent to your email.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;You agree to provide accurate and complete information during registration and keep it updated.&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;3. Use of Services&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;You agree to use Harley\'s Clan Forum only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these Terms. You must not:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Use our services in any way that violates any applicable law or Discord\'s Terms of Service.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Engage in conduct that restricts or inhibits anyone else\'s use of the services.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Impersonate any person or entity or misrepresent your affiliation.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;4. Data Collection and Privacy&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nHarley\'s Clan Forum may collect and store information from Discord, Google, or system accounts including username, avatar, email address, and service interactions. We respect your privacy and will not share your information with third parties without consent except as required by law.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;5. Intellectual Property&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nAll content, trademarks, and intellectual property associated with Harley\'s Clan Forum are the property of Harley-THE-GAMER (HarleyTG) or licensors. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without written permission.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;6. Termination&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nWe reserve the right to suspend or terminate access at any time without notice for conduct that violates these Terms or harms other users or services.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;7. Disclaimer of Warranties&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nHarley\'s Clan Forum is provided on an \"as-is\" and \"as-available\" basis. We make no warranties regarding the operation or availability of the services.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;8. Limitation of Liability&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nTo the fullest extent permitted by law, Harley-THE-GAMER (HarleyTG) shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from the use of our services.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;9. Changes to These Terms&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nWe may revise these Terms from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page. Continued use of services after updates constitutes acceptance.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;section&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;margin-top:30px;\"&gt;10. Contact Us&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;If you have questions about these Terms:&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7\">https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7</URL>\" target=\"<EM><s>_</s>blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Harley\'s Clan Discord Server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.com/\">https://forum.harleytg.com/</URL>\" target=\"<e>_</e></EM>blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Harley\'s Clan Forum Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.com/p/10-help-document\">https://forum.harleytg.com/p/10-help-document</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Help Document&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/section&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/main&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(10,'Help Document','help-document','2025-01-10 02:23:00','2026-07-23 23:06:16','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;title&gt;Help Document - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;body style=\"background-color: #0a0a0a; margin: 0; padding: 20px; font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace; color: #e8e8e8; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<i>    </i><CODE>&lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>    max-width: 850px;\n<i>    </i>    width: 100%;\n<i>    </i>    background-color: rgba(25, 25, 25, 0.95);\n<i>    </i>    border: 2px solid #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>    padding: 30px;\n<i>    </i>    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n<i>    </i>    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n<i>    </i>\"&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>        width: 120px;\n<i>    </i>        height: 120px;\n<i>    </i>        background: url(\'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png\') center/cover no-repeat;\n<i>    </i>        border-radius: 50%;\n<i>    </i>        border: 3px solid #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>        box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>        margin: 0 auto 20px auto;\n<i>    </i>    \"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>        text-align: center;\n<i>    </i>        color: #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>        font-size: 32px;\n<i>    </i>        font-weight: bold;\n<i>    </i>        letter-spacing: 4px;\n<i>    </i>        text-transform: uppercase;\n<i>    </i>        margin-bottom: 8px;\n<i>    </i>        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5);\n<i>    </i>    \"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        Help Document\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        HARLEY\'S CLAN FORUM &amp;mdash; TERMS &amp;amp; ACCOUNT GUIDE\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;p style=\"margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.6; border-bottom: 2px solid #00ffff; padding-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        Welcome to Harley\'s Clan Forum! This document will guide you through our key Terms of Service highlights and account management options to ensure a smooth experience.\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/p&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;I. Key Terms of Service Highlights&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-left: 10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[AGE REQUIREMENT]&lt;/span&gt; You must be at least 13 years old or have parental consent to use the platform.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[ACCOUNT SETUP]&lt;/span&gt; Sign up or log in via Discord or our internal system, with password-based or passwordless options. Provide accurate and updated information during registration.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[PRIVACY]&lt;/span&gt; We may collect user data (e.g., usernames, avatars, email addresses) to enhance your experience. Your data is protected and only shared as required by law.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[USAGE RULES]&lt;/span&gt; Use the forum lawfully, avoid impersonation, and follow Discord\'s Terms of Service when applicable.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY]&lt;/span&gt; All trademarks and content belong to Harley-THE-GAMER (HarleyTG) or licensors. Unauthorized reproduction or distribution is prohibited.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[TERMINATION]&lt;/span&gt; Accounts violating our terms may be suspended or terminated without notice.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[DISCLAIMER &amp;amp; LIABILITY]&lt;/span&gt; Services are provided \"as-is.\" We are not responsible for damages caused by service disruptions or errors.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;II. Account Management&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\"&gt;You can sign up or log in using the following options:&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;\"&gt;DISCORD&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;Use your Discord credentials for quick access.&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;PASSWORD-BASED&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;Set up a secure password during registration.&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;PASSWORDLESS&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;Verify your login via a time-sensitive email link.&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/table&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0; font-size: 14px;\"&gt;Be sure to keep your account information up to date and choose a secure password for password-based login.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;III. Support&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\"&gt;If you have questions or need assistance, contact us through the following channels:&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;\"&gt;DISCORD SERVER&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    &lt;a href=\"https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: none;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                        Harley\'s Clan Forum Discord Server [Official]\n<i>    </i>                    &lt;/a&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;FORUM WEBSITE&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    &lt;a href=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: none;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                        Harley\'s Clan Forum Website\n<i>    </i>                    &lt;/a&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/table&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left:4px solid #00ffff;padding-left:10px;color:#00ffff;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            IV. Footer Information\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/h3&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin:5px 0 15px 0;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            The Harley\'s Clan Forum footer provides useful information about your current session and quick navigation tools.\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/p&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>        &lt;table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);\"&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);color:#00ffff;font-weight:bold;width:32%;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    BACK TO TOP\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    Instantly returns you to the top of any forum page.\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);color:#00ffff;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    IDENTITY\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    Displays your current forum username as\n<i>    </i>                    &lt;a href=\"https://forum.harleytg.com/u/HarleyTG\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;\"&gt;@HarleyTG&lt;/a&gt;.\n<i>    </i>                    Guests will see &lt;strong&gt;GUEST_PROTOCOL&lt;/strong&gt;.\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);color:#00ffff;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    ACTIVE SESSION\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    When available, your currently active session IP address is displayed from your Security page.\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);color:#00ffff;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    UTC &amp;amp; LOCAL TIME\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    Shows both Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) and your local date, time, and detected time zone.\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>            &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);color:#00ffff;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    PRIVACY NOTICE\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;td style=\"padding:12px;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                    Footer information is processed locally within your browser whenever possible. No additional personal data is transmitted by the footer itself.\n<i>    </i>                &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/tr&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/table&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;strong style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Tip:&lt;/strong&gt;\n<i>    </i>            The footer is available throughout Harley\'s Clan Forum and is designed to provide quick access to helpful session and time information.\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-top: 30px; padding: 15px; border: 1px dashed #00ffff; background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;strong style=\"color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;Policy Updates:&lt;/strong&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            Continued use of the forum signifies agreement to updated Terms of Service. Check back here periodically to stay informed.\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 25px; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 2px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        HARLEY\'S CLAN FORUM // HELP DOCUMENT\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;</CODE>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p>\n</r>',0,1,0),
(11,'No-Reply Consent Info','no-reply-consent-info','2025-01-16 20:22:08','2026-03-28 04:21:12','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;title&gt;No-Reply Consent Information - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;body style=\"background-color:#0a0a0b; background-image:radial-gradient(circle at center, #1a1a20 0%, #050505 100%); margin:0; padding:40px 20px; font-family:\'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color:#d1d1d1; line-height:1.6; display:flex; justify-content:center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<i>    </i><CODE>&lt;div style=\"max-width:850px; width:100%; background:#141417; border:1px solid #222; border-top:4px solid #00f2ff; padding:45px; box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); border-radius:8px;\"&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;header style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a2e; padding-bottom:30px; margin-bottom:35px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h1 style=\"margin:0; font-size:32px; color:#00f2ff; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:3px; font-family:\'Courier New\', monospace; text-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,242,255,0.3);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            No-Reply Consent Information\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/h1&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;div style=\"display:inline-block; margin-top:15px; padding:4px 12px; background:rgba(0,242,255,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(0,242,255,0.3); border-radius:4px; font-size:12px; color:#00f2ff; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            SYSTEM STATUS: ACTIVE\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-top:20px; font-size:14px; color:#888;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;strong&gt;Effective Date:&lt;/strong&gt; January 1, 2024\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/header&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;section style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border-radius:8px; padding:25px; margin-bottom:35px; border-left:4px solid #00f2ff;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2 style=\"color:#00f2ff; margin-top:0; font-size:20px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px;\"&gt;Important Notice&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p&gt;This page provides official details regarding automated consent and verification messages sent by &lt;strong&gt;HarleyTG Systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        \n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;Verification emails are dispatched from these automated addresses:&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;div style=\"background:#000; padding:18px; border-radius:6px; border:1px dashed #444; font-family:\'Courier New\', monospace; color:#00f2ff; font-size:15px; text-align:center; word-break:break-all; box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            no-reply@mailsys.harleytg.com &lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>            noreply+harleysclan@freeflarum.com\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"font-size:13px; color:#888; margin-top:15px; font-style:italic;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            Note: These addresses are used for outbound notifications only. Inbound mail is &lt;strong&gt;not monitored&lt;/strong&gt; and replies will not be received.\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;section style=\"margin-bottom:30px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2 style=\"color:#00f2ff; font-size:20px; border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a2e; padding-bottom:10px; text-transform:uppercase;\"&gt;1. Why You May Receive This Email&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul style=\"padding-left:20px; color:#b0b0b0;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;Parental consent verification (COPPA compliance).&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;Account security alerts &amp; password reset requests.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;Account registration and email ownership confirmation.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;Identity or age verification for specific forum features.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;section style=\"margin-bottom:30px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2 style=\"color:#00f2ff; font-size:20px; border-bottom:1px solid #2a2a2e; padding-bottom:10px; text-transform:uppercase;\"&gt;2. Users Under 18&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p&gt;To ensure a safe environment, users under 18 must follow specific protocols:&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul style=\"padding-left:20px; color:#b0b0b0;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Under 13:&lt;/strong&gt; Verifiable parental consent is strictly required by U.S. law (COPPA).&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ages 13–17:&lt;/strong&gt; Parental awareness or consent may be requested depending on community requirements.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;section style=\"margin-top:45px; padding:30px; background:rgba(0,242,255,0.02); border:1px solid #222; border-radius:8px; text-align:center;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2 style=\"color:#00f2ff; font-size:20px; margin-top:0;\"&gt;Need Assistance?&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom:25px;\"&gt;Do not reply to automated emails. Use our official support channels below:&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        \n<i>    </i>        &lt;div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            \n<i>    </i>            &lt;a href=\"https://forum.harleytg.com/p/17-support\" \n<i>    </i>               target=\"_blank\" \n<i>    </i>               onmouseover=\"this.style.transform=\'translateY(-4px)\'; this.style.boxShadow=\'0 8px 25px rgba(0,242,255,0.5)\'; this.style.backgroundColor=\'#fff\';\" \n<i>    </i>               onmouseout=\"this.style.transform=\'translateY(0)\'; this.style.boxShadow=\'0 4px 15px rgba(0,242,255,0.2)\'; this.style.backgroundColor=\'#00f2ff\';\"\n<i>    </i>               onmousedown=\"this.style.transform=\'translateY(1px)\';\"\n<i>    </i>               style=\"\n<i>    </i>                display:inline-block; \n<i>    </i>                padding:16px 32px; \n<i>    </i>                background:#00f2ff; \n<i>    </i>                color:#000; \n<i>    </i>                text-decoration:none; \n<i>    </i>                font-weight:bold; \n<i>    </i>                border-radius:6px; \n<i>    </i>                transition: all 0.25s ease; \n<i>    </i>                box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,242,255,0.2);\n<i>    </i>                text-transform: uppercase;\n<i>    </i>                letter-spacing: 1px;\n<i>    </i>                font-size: 14px;\n<i>    </i>               \"&gt;\n<i>    </i>               Visit Forum\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/a&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>            &lt;a href=\"https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7\" \n<i>    </i>               target=\"_blank\" \n<i>    </i>               onmouseover=\"this.style.transform=\'translateY(-4px)\'; this.style.background=\'rgba(0,242,255,0.15)\'; this.style.boxShadow=\'0 8px 25px rgba(0,242,255,0.2)\';\" \n<i>    </i>               onmouseout=\"this.style.transform=\'translateY(0)\'; this.style.background=\'transparent\'; this.style.boxShadow=\'none\';\"\n<i>    </i>               onmousedown=\"this.style.transform=\'translateY(1px)\';\"\n<i>    </i>               style=\"\n<i>    </i>                display:inline-block; \n<i>    </i>                padding:14px 30px; \n<i>    </i>                border:2px solid #00f2ff; \n<i>    </i>                background: transparent;\n<i>    </i>                color:#00f2ff; \n<i>    </i>                text-decoration:none; \n<i>    </i>                font-weight:bold; \n<i>    </i>                border-radius:6px; \n<i>    </i>                transition: all 0.25s ease;\n<i>    </i>                text-transform: uppercase;\n<i>    </i>                letter-spacing: 1px;\n<i>    </i>                font-size: 14px;\n<i>    </i>               \"&gt;\n<i>    </i>               Join Discord\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/a&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;footer style=\"margin-top:60px; border-top:1px solid #2a2a2e; padding-top:30px; font-size:12px; color:#666; text-align:center; letter-spacing:1px; font-family:\'Courier New\', monospace;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin:0;\"&gt;© 2026 HARLEY-THE-GAMER (HARLEYTG). ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0; color:#444;\"&gt;SECURITY INFRASTRUCTURE V.2.4.0&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/footer&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;</CODE>\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(14,'Downloads','downloads','2025-01-20 22:08:02','2026-03-04 23:43:05','<t><p>[Disabled]</p></t>',0,0,0),
(15,'Staff Rules','staff-rules','2025-02-18 15:37:04','2025-02-18 15:37:42','<r><p>=====================================</p>\n<H1> Moderator &amp; Admin Rules - Harley\'s Forum<e>\n=====================================</e></H1>\n\n<p>== General Conduct ==</p>\n<LIST type=\"decimal\"><LI><s>1. </s>Be Professional &amp; Respectful – Treat all users with respect. No harassment, discrimination, or abuse of power.</LI>\n<LI><s>2. </s>Lead by Example – Maintain a positive and constructive environment. Follow the same rules as members.</LI>\n<LI><s>3. </s>No Favoritism – Do not give special treatment to friends or certain users. Apply rules fairly to everyone.</LI>\n<LI><s>4. </s>Stay Active &amp; Engaged – Regularly participate in discussions, assist users, and ensure a safe environment.</LI></LIST>\n\n<p>== Moderation Duties ==</p>\n<LIST start=\"5\" type=\"decimal\"><LI><s>5. </s>Enforce Forum Rules – Take appropriate action against rule violations, such as issuing warnings, mutes, or bans.</LI>\n<LI><s>6. </s>Keep Forums Organized – Move, merge, or lock threads when necessary to keep discussions relevant and structured.</LI>\n<LI><s>7. </s>Monitor Reports &amp; Complaints – Review and respond to user reports in a timely manner.</LI>\n<LI><s>8. </s>No Unjustified Actions – Provide valid reasons when issuing warnings, mutes, or bans. Always document actions.</LI>\n<LI><s>9. </s>Follow the Escalation Process – If an issue is beyond your authority, escalate it to a higher-ranking admin.</LI></LIST>\n\n<p>== Admin-Specific Rules ==</p>\n<LIST start=\"10\" type=\"decimal\"><LI><s>10. </s>Maintain Technical Integrity – Do not make unauthorized changes to the forum’s settings, permissions, or user accounts.</LI>\n<LI><s>11. </s>Fair &amp; Transparent Decision-Making – Ensure rule changes, bans, and major decisions are discussed within the admin team.</LI>\n<LI><s>12. </s>Protect User Privacy – Never leak private messages, IP addresses, or any personal data.</LI>\n<LI><s>13. </s>No Abuse of Power – Do not edit or delete posts unfairly, and do not ban users without a valid reason.</LI>\n<LI><s>14. </s>Support &amp; Guide Moderators – Assist moderators when needed and ensure they are following guidelines properly.</LI></LIST>\n\n<p>== Conflict Resolution ==</p>\n<LIST start=\"15\" type=\"decimal\"><LI><s>15. </s>Do Not Engage in Arguments – If a disagreement arises, handle it privately and professionally.</LI>\n<LI><s>16. </s>Use Internal Discussions – Bring up major disputes or concerns with other staff members before taking action.</LI>\n<LI><s>17. </s>Appeals &amp; Unbans – Users should have the right to appeal bans; handle appeals fairly and review all evidence.</LI></LIST>\n\n<p>== Miscellaneous ==</p>\n<LIST start=\"18\" type=\"decimal\"><LI><s>18. </s>No Unauthorized Self-Promotion – Do not use your position to promote personal content or services.</LI>\n<LI><s>19. </s>Stay Updated – Keep up with staff meetings, announcements, and any policy changes.</LI>\n<LI><s>20. </s>If You Resign or Are Removed – Respect the decision and do not cause drama or disrupt the forum.</LI></LIST>\n</r>',0,0,0),
(16,'Staff Application','staff-application','2025-02-18 15:38:44','2026-03-17 00:05:50','<r xmlns:html=\"urn:s9e:TextFormatter:html\"><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;title&gt;HarleyTG Staff Application Terminal&lt;/title&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;style&gt;<br/>\n@keyframes pulse {<br/>\n0%{opacity:.4}<br/>\n50%{opacity:1}<br/>\n100%{opacity:.4}<br/>\n}</p>\n\n<p>@keyframes spin {<br/>\n0%{transform:rotate(0deg)}<br/>\n100%{transform:rotate(360deg)}<br/>\n}<br/>\n&lt;/style&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/head&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;body style=\"background-color:#0a0a0a;margin:0;padding:20px;font-family:\'Courier New\',monospace;color:#e8e8e8;display:flex;justify-content:center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nmax-width:850px;<br/>\nwidth:100%;<br/>\nbackground-color:rgba(25,25,25,0.95);<br/>\nborder:2px solid #00ffff;<br/>\npadding:30px;<br/>\nbox-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(0,255,255,0.2);<br/>\nbackdrop-filter:blur(12px);<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\ntext-align:center;<br/>\ncolor:#00ffff;<br/>\nfont-size:32px;<br/>\nfont-weight:bold;<br/>\nletter-spacing:4px;<br/>\ntext-transform:uppercase;<br/>\nmargin-bottom:25px;<br/>\ntext-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.5);<br/>\n\"&gt;<br/>\nHarleyTG Staff Application Terminal<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;border-bottom:2px solid #00ffff;padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:20px;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nwidth:120px;<br/>\nheight:120px;<br/>\nbackground:url(\'<URL url=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png\">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png</URL>\') center/cover no-repeat;<br/>\nborder-radius:50%;<br/>\nborder:3px solid #00ffff;<br/>\nbox-shadow:0 0 15px #00ffff;<br/>\nflex-shrink:0;<br/>\n\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#00ffff;text-transform:uppercase;\"&gt;Support / Admin Application&lt;/h1&gt;<br/>\n&lt;p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:18px;\"&gt;REQUEST TYPE: &lt;strong&gt;STAFF / ADMIN APPLICATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;span style=\"border:1px solid #00ffff;padding:3px 8px;font-size:13px;background:rgba(0,255,255,0.1);\"&gt;SYSTEM: RECRUITMENT NODE&lt;/span&gt;<br/>\n&lt;span style=\"border:1px solid #00ffff;padding:3px 8px;font-size:13px;background:rgba(0,255,255,0.1);margin-left:10px;\"&gt;STATUS: ACCEPTING APPLICATIONS&lt;/span&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;p&gt;Submit a staff application using the embedded terminal below.&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;p&gt;If the form fails to load use the direct link:<br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdBLT2Nz0CGI_PWN1GY0_5EINCkF1BRgZpopFsPUQN0Bgpm9w/viewform\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdBLT2Nz0CGI_PWN1GY0_5EINCkF1BRgZpopFsPUQN0Bgpm9w/viewform</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;\"&gt;Open Staff Application&lt;/a&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,0.2);padding:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div id=\"loader\" style=\"<br/>\nposition:absolute;<br/>\ntop:0;<br/>\nleft:0;<br/>\nwidth:100%;<br/>\nheight:100%;<br/>\ndisplay:flex;<br/>\nflex-direction:column;<br/>\nalign-items:center;<br/>\njustify-content:center;<br/>\nbackground:#0a0a0a;<br/>\nz-index:10;<br/>\ncolor:#00ffff;<br/>\ntext-align:center;<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nwidth:40px;<br/>\nheight:40px;<br/>\nborder:3px solid rgba(0,255,255,.3);<br/>\nborder-top:3px solid #00ffff;<br/>\nborder-radius:50%;<br/>\nanimation:spin 1s linear infinite;<br/>\nmargin-bottom:15px;<br/>\n\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"animation:pulse 1.5s infinite;\"&gt;<br/>\nACCESSING STAFF APPLICATION DATABASE...<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p><html:iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"1200\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdBLT2Nz0CGI_PWN1GY0_5EINCkF1BRgZpopFsPUQN0Bgpm9w/viewform?embedded=true\" style=\"border:none;\" width=\"100%\"><s>&lt;iframe\nonload=\"document.getElementById(\'loader\').style.display=\'none\';\"\nsrc=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdBLT2Nz0CGI_PWN1GY0_5EINCkF1BRgZpopFsPUQN0Bgpm9w/viewform?embedded=true\"\nwidth=\"100%\"\nheight=\"1200\"\nframeborder=\"0\"\nmarginheight=\"0\"\nmarginwidth=\"0\"\nstyle=\"border:none;\"&gt;</s><br/>\nLoading…<br/>\n<e>&lt;/iframe&gt;</e></html:iframe></p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"text-align:center;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,0.3);padding-top:15px;margin-top:25px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.7;letter-spacing:2px;\"&gt;<br/>\nRECRUITMENT CHANNEL VERIFIED // HARLEYTG NETWORK<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(17,'Support','support','2025-02-22 13:09:04','2026-03-16 23:44:08','<r xmlns:html=\"urn:s9e:TextFormatter:html\"><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;title&gt;Harley\'s Clan Support Terminal&lt;/title&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;style&gt;<br/>\n@keyframes pulse {<br/>\n0%{opacity:.4}<br/>\n50%{opacity:1}<br/>\n100%{opacity:.4}<br/>\n}</p>\n\n<p>@keyframes spin {<br/>\n0%{transform:rotate(0deg)}<br/>\n100%{transform:rotate(360deg)}<br/>\n}<br/>\n&lt;/style&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/head&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;body style=\"background-color:#0a0a0a;margin:0;padding:20px;font-family:\'Courier New\',monospace;color:#e8e8e8;display:flex;justify-content:center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nmax-width:850px;<br/>\nwidth:100%;<br/>\nbackground-color:rgba(25,25,25,0.95);<br/>\nborder:2px solid #00ffff;<br/>\npadding:30px;<br/>\nbox-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(0,255,255,0.2);<br/>\nbackdrop-filter:blur(12px);<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\ntext-align:center;<br/>\ncolor:#00ffff;<br/>\nfont-size:32px;<br/>\nfont-weight:bold;<br/>\nletter-spacing:4px;<br/>\ntext-transform:uppercase;<br/>\nmargin-bottom:25px;<br/>\ntext-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.5);<br/>\n\"&gt;<br/>\nHarley\'s Clan Support Terminal<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;border-bottom:2px solid #00ffff;padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:20px;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nwidth:120px;<br/>\nheight:120px;<br/>\nbackground:url(\'<URL url=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png\">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png</URL>\') center/cover no-repeat;<br/>\nborder-radius:50%;<br/>\nborder:3px solid #00ffff;<br/>\nbox-shadow:0 0 15px #00ffff;<br/>\nflex-shrink:0;<br/>\n\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div&gt;<br/>\n&lt;h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#00ffff;text-transform:uppercase;\"&gt;Clan Support&lt;/h1&gt;<br/>\n&lt;p style=\"margin:5px 0;font-size:18px;\"&gt;REQUEST TYPE: &lt;strong&gt;TECH / COMMUNITY / CLAN HELP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"margin-top:10px;\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;span style=\"border:1px solid #00ffff;padding:3px 8px;font-size:13px;background:rgba(0,255,255,0.1);\"&gt;SYSTEM: SUPPORT NODE&lt;/span&gt;<br/>\n&lt;span style=\"border:1px solid #00ffff;padding:3px 8px;font-size:13px;background:rgba(0,255,255,0.1);margin-left:10px;\"&gt;STATUS: ACTIVE&lt;/span&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;p&gt;Submit a support request using the embedded terminal below.&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;p&gt;If the form fails to load use the direct link:<br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forms.gle/ZttwfojRdTEUo8Pf9\">https://forms.gle/ZttwfojRdTEUo8Pf9</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;\"&gt;Open Support Form&lt;/a&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"position:relative;border:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,0.2);padding:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;!-- Loading Overlay --&gt;<br/>\n&lt;div id=\"loader\" style=\"<br/>\nposition:absolute;<br/>\ntop:0;<br/>\nleft:0;<br/>\nwidth:100%;<br/>\nheight:100%;<br/>\ndisplay:flex;<br/>\nflex-direction:column;<br/>\nalign-items:center;<br/>\njustify-content:center;<br/>\nbackground:#0a0a0a;<br/>\nz-index:10;<br/>\ncolor:#00ffff;<br/>\ntext-align:center;<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nwidth:40px;<br/>\nheight:40px;<br/>\nborder:3px solid rgba(0,255,255,.3);<br/>\nborder-top:3px solid #00ffff;<br/>\nborder-radius:50%;<br/>\nanimation:spin 1s linear infinite;<br/>\nmargin-bottom:15px;<br/>\n\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"animation:pulse 1.5s infinite;\"&gt;<br/>\nACCESSING SUPPORT DATABASE...<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p><html:iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"1264\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdl7QLNNYPPnU0xxB32rQ6BmmWDs9SUS2yqVYAvYiD0e3R2GA/viewform?embedded=true\" style=\"border:none;\" width=\"100%\"><s>&lt;iframe\nonload=\"document.getElementById(\'loader\').style.display=\'none\';\"\nsrc=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdl7QLNNYPPnU0xxB32rQ6BmmWDs9SUS2yqVYAvYiD0e3R2GA/viewform?embedded=true\"\nwidth=\"100%\"\nheight=\"1264\"\nframeborder=\"0\"\nmarginheight=\"0\"\nmarginwidth=\"0\"\nstyle=\"border:none;\"&gt;</s><br/>\n<e>&lt;/iframe&gt;</e></html:iframe></p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"text-align:center;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,0.3);padding-top:15px;margin-top:25px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.7;letter-spacing:2px;\"&gt;<br/>\nSUPPORT CHANNEL VERIFIED // HARLEY\'S CLAN NETWORK<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(18,'Cookies Policy','cookies-policy','2025-02-26 09:49:23','2025-02-26 10:03:39','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;title&gt;Cookie Policy - HarleyTG&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;body&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;header&gt;<br/>\n        &lt;h1&gt;Cookie Policy&lt;/h1&gt;<br/>\n        &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Last Updated:&lt;/strong&gt; [2/2/2025]&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;/header&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;main&gt;<br/>\n        &lt;section&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;h2&gt;1. What Are Cookies?&lt;/h2&gt;<br/>\n            &lt;p&gt;Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help us recognize your preferences, maintain security, and improve site functionality.&lt;/p&gt;<br/>\n        &lt;/section&gt;</p>\n        <br/>\n<i>    </i><CODE>    &lt;section&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2&gt;2. Types of Cookies We Use&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3&gt;Essential Cookies&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flarum_session&lt;/strong&gt; – Maintains your session and login state. (Expires: Short-term session-based)&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flarum_remember&lt;/strong&gt; – Keeps you logged in after closing the browser. (Expires: Long-term)&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>        \n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3&gt;Preference Cookies&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;flarum_nightmode&lt;/strong&gt; – Saves your night mode preference. (Expires: End of session)&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>        \n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3&gt;Security &amp; Performance Cookies&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;isg&lt;/strong&gt; – Used for session integrity and security. (Expires: August 17, 2025)&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tfstk&lt;/strong&gt; – Used for session tracking and security validation. (Expires: August 17, 2025)&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n<i>    </i>    \n<i>    </i>    &lt;section&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2&gt;3. How We Use Cookies&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p&gt;We use cookies to:&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;Keep you logged in securely.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;Save your night mode preferences.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;Improve security and prevent fraud.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;Analyze website traffic and enhance performance.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n<i>    </i>    \n<i>    </i>    &lt;section&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2&gt;4. Managing Cookies&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p&gt;You can control or delete cookies in your browser settings. However, disabling essential cookies may affect your ability to log in or use certain features.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"chrome://settings/cookies\"&gt;Manage cookies in Chrome&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"about:preferences#privacy\"&gt;Manage cookies in Firefox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"edge://settings/content/cookies\"&gt;Manage cookies in Edge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT201265\"&gt;Manage cookies in Safari&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n<i>    </i>    \n<i>    </i>    &lt;section&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2&gt;5. Changes to This Policy&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p&gt;We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a new \"Last Updated\" date.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n<i>    </i>    \n<i>    </i>    &lt;section&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h2&gt;6. Contact Us&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p&gt;If you have any questions about this Cookie Policy, please visit our support page: &lt;a href=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/p/17-support\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;HarleyTG Support&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/section&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;/main&gt;</CODE>\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(19,'Admin Email','admin-email','2025-02-27 19:35:41','2026-03-04 23:41:39','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;title&gt;Admin Support Email - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;body&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;h1&gt;Admin Support Email - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/h1&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Date:&lt;/strong&gt; 1/1/2025&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n    <br/>\n<i>    </i><CODE>&lt;h2&gt;&#128231; Primary Contact Email&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This email address is no longer active.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;If you need support or have general inquiries, please use the alternative contact methods below:&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>\n<i>    </i>&lt;h2&gt;&#128204; Types of Emails &amp; What to Do&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#128313; Support Requests&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>If you need help with your account, forum issues, or technical difficulties:&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>➡ Clearly describe your issue (username, error messages, steps taken).&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>➡ Our team will respond as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#128313; General Inquiries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>For non-support questions regarding community guidelines, partnerships, or other topics:&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>➡ Provide a concise and clear message.&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>➡ We will respond as needed.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#128313; Feedback &amp; Suggestions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>Have ideas to improve the forum?&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>➡ Send a detailed description of your feedback or suggestion.&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>➡ We will consider it for future updates.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>\n<i>    </i>&lt;h2&gt;⏳ Expected Response Time&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;✔ Our team strives to reply within 24-48 hours.&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>✔ Response time may vary based on inquiry volume and complexity.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>\n<i>    </i>&lt;h2&gt;&#128226; Alternative Contact Methods&lt;/h2&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;&#127760; &lt;a href=\"https://clan.harleytg.online\"&gt;Discord Server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;p&gt;&#127760; &lt;a href=\"https://forum.harleytg.online\"&gt;Forum Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>\n<i>    </i>    &lt;footer&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;!-- Copyright with dynamic year --&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p&gt;&amp;copy; &lt;span id=\"current-year\"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Harley-THE-GAMER (HarleyTG). All Rights Reserved.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/footer&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;/main&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;!-- JavaScript to set the current year --&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;script type=\"text/javascript\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    // Set the current year dynamically\n<i>    </i>    document.getElementById(\'current-year\').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\n<i>    </i>&lt;/script&gt;</CODE>\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(21,'Parental Consent & ID Verification','underage-id-verify','2026-03-06 05:38:34','2026-03-16 23:36:17','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;title&gt;Parental Consent &amp; ID Verification - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;body style=\"background-color:#0a0a0a;margin:0;padding:20px;font-family:\'Courier New\',monospace;color:#e8e8e8;display:flex;justify-content:center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\nmax-width:850px;<br/>\nwidth:100%;<br/>\nbackground-color:rgba(25,25,25,0.95);<br/>\nborder:2px solid #00ffff;<br/>\npadding:30px;<br/>\nbox-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(0,255,255,0.2);<br/>\n\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\ntext-align:center;<br/>\ncolor:#00ffff;<br/>\nfont-size:32px;<br/>\nfont-weight:bold;<br/>\nletter-spacing:4px;<br/>\ntext-transform:uppercase;<br/>\nmargin-bottom:25px;<br/>\ntext-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.5);<br/>\n\"&gt;<br/>\nParental Consent &amp; ID Verification<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Date:&lt;/strong&gt; 1/1/2024&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nWelcome to Harley\'s Clan Forum. In compliance with U.S. law, all users under the age of 18 must obtain verifiable consent from a parent or legal guardian before accessing our services.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;hr style=\"border-color:#00ffff;opacity:0.3;margin:25px 0;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;1. Who Needs Parental Consent?&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;Any user under the age of 18 must have explicit parental consent before using the platform.&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Users under 13:&lt;/strong&gt; COPPA requires parental consent before collecting personal data.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Users aged 13-17:&lt;/strong&gt; While COPPA doesn\'t apply, we still require parental consent for protection.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;2. How Parental Consent Works&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ol&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Child Registration:&lt;/strong&gt; The underage user enters a parent or guardian’s email.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Team Verification:&lt;/strong&gt; Our support team may request identity verification.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consent Confirmation:&lt;/strong&gt; Parent confirms consent via email link.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Activation:&lt;/strong&gt; Once verified, the account is activated with appropriate restrictions.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ol&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;3. Underage Detection and Consequences&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Suspension or Ban:&lt;/strong&gt; Accounts may be suspended until consent is verified.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Verification:&lt;/strong&gt; If detected in gameplay, Discord VC, or forum activity, parental consent must be confirmed.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;4. ID Verification for Users Over 18&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nHarley’s Clan may request ID verification for users over 18 to ensure accurate age representation and maintain a secure community environment.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;To confirm a user\'s age if suspected to be underage.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Case-by-case verification for community safety.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nID verification is handled through <STRONG><s>**</s>Discord support tickets<e>**</e></STRONG> in the official Harley\'s Clan Discord server.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;5. Privacy &amp; Data Protection&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nInformation collected during parental verification or ID verification is securely handled and used only for consent confirmation or age verification. It will not be shared with third parties.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;6. Legal References&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COPPA (Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minor Consent Regulations (13-17)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Online Safety &amp; Privacy Regulations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;7. Parent / Guardian Instructions&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ol&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Check your email for the verification message.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Submit proof of guardianship if requested.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Click the confirmation link to approve consent.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Once verified, the child’s account will be activated.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ol&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h3 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;Appeal Process&lt;/h3&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ol&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Follow instructions in the system email regarding the suspension.&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Submit an appeal at <br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://banned.harleytg.com\">https://banned.harleytg.com</URL>\" target=\"<EM><s>_</s>blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;\"&gt;<br/>\nbanned.harleytg.com<br/>\n&lt;/a&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;Appeal through the official <br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7\">https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7</URL>\" target=\"<e>_</e></EM>blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;\"&gt;<br/>\nHarley\'s Clan Discord Server<br/>\n&lt;/a&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ol&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;8. Addressing Past Security Issues&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nIn 2023, Harley\'s Clan experienced an incident involving individuals who attempted to manipulate the system by posing as older users. Following this event, the community migrated servers and implemented stronger verification procedures.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;9. Communication Policies&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nDirect messaging from underage users is not allowed. All communication must occur in monitored public channels on the forum or official Discord server.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nContent involving minors remains &lt;strong&gt;PG-13&lt;/strong&gt;. Adult discussions may occur only in restricted channels when minors are not present.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;10. Transparency &amp; Reporting&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;p&gt;<br/>\nCommunity members are encouraged to report suspicious behavior. This transparency system has helped maintain a safe environment and prevent exploitation.<br/>\n&lt;/p&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;h2 style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;11. Contact Support&lt;/h2&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br/>\n&lt;li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/\">https://forum.harleytg.online/</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;\"&gt;<br/>\nHarley\'s Clan Forum<br/>\n&lt;/a&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/li&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;a href=\"<URL url=\"https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7\">https://discord.gg/JnAY97BRw7</URL>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff;text-decoration:none;\"&gt;<br/>\nHarley\'s Clan Discord Server<br/>\n&lt;/a&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/li&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/ul&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\ntext-align:center;<br/>\nborder-top:1px solid rgba(0,255,255,0.3);<br/>\npadding-top:15px;<br/>\nmargin-top:25px;<br/>\nfont-size:12px;<br/>\nopacity:0.7;<br/>\nletter-spacing:2px;<br/>\n\"&gt;<br/>\nLEGAL POLICY NODE // HARLEY\'S CLAN NETWORK<br/>\n&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(22,'About @HarleyTG','about-harleytg','2026-03-16 21:05:29','2026-03-16 22:52:37','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;title&gt;Harley\'s Clan Dossier - HarleyTG&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;body style=\"background-color: #0a0a0a; margin: 0; padding: 20px; font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace; color: #e8e8e8; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<i>    </i><CODE>&lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>    max-width: 850px;\n<i>    </i>    width: 100%;\n<i>    </i>    background-color: rgba(25, 25, 25, 0.95);\n<i>    </i>    border: 2px solid #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>    padding: 30px;\n<i>    </i>    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n<i>    </i>    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n<i>    </i>\"&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>        text-align: center; \n<i>    </i>        color: #00ffff; \n<i>    </i>        font-size: 32px; \n<i>    </i>        font-weight: bold; \n<i>    </i>        letter-spacing: 4px; \n<i>    </i>        text-transform: uppercase; \n<i>    </i>        margin-bottom: 25px; \n<i>    </i>        text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5);\n<i>    </i>    \"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        Harley\'s Clan Dossier\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; border-bottom: 2px solid #00ffff; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>            width: 120px; \n<i>    </i>            height: 120px; \n<i>    </i>            background: url(\'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png\') center/cover no-repeat; \n<i>    </i>            border-radius: 50%; \n<i>    </i>            border: 3px solid #00ffff; \n<i>    </i>            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00ffff; \n<i>    </i>            flex-shrink: 0;\n<i>    </i>        \"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>        \n<i>    </i>        &lt;div&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 28px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;Harley-The-Gamer&lt;/h1&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0; font-size: 18px;\"&gt;RANK: &lt;strong&gt;CLAN LEADER / CONTENT CREATOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;div style=\"margin-top: 10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;span style=\"border: 1px solid #00ffff; padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\"&gt;CALL SIGN: HarleyTG&lt;/span&gt;\n<i>    </i>                &lt;span style=\"border: 1px solid #00ffff; padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1); margin-left: 10px;\"&gt;ID: harleytg_&lt;/span&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 25px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold; width: 30%;\"&gt;TWITCH LINK&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;&lt;a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/harleytg_\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #00ffff; text-decoration: none;\"&gt;twitch.tv/harleytg_&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;OPERATOR PROFILE&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;Multifaceted (Female characters in specific theaters)&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;ENLISTMENT&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;June 10, 2020 (Star Citizen Secondary Account)&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;PRIMARY TECH&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;ROG Ally X | Gaming Laptop | PlayStation 4&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;STATUS&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;Mentally Disabled (Patience &amp; Respect Requested)&lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/table&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;I. Star Citizen Service Record&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTU PATHFINDER:&lt;/strong&gt; Active testing of upcoming patches and experimental builds.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 10px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PU OPERATIONAL ROLES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-left: 10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[COMBAT MEDIC]&lt;/span&gt; Field medical extraction and assistance.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[RIDE GIVER]&lt;/span&gt; Transporting stranded pilots and new players.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;[MENTOR]&lt;/span&gt; Guiding new enrollees through initial flight and tactical systems.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;II. Deployment Timeline&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2018 - 2020:&lt;/strong&gt; Minecraft &amp; Roblox engineering (Complex logic/Redstone foundation).&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2023 - 2025:&lt;/strong&gt; Conan Exiles Narrative Roleplay (Specialized Female Lead Character).&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2025 - 2026:&lt;/strong&gt; ARC Raiders Tactical Extraction (Specialized Female Lead Character).&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SPECIAL OPS:&lt;/strong&gt; Post-2022 mobile broadcasting via Kindle Fire (Minecraft/Roblox content).&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;III. Hardware Evolution&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LEGACY SYSTEMS:&lt;/strong&gt; PS2, Nintendo DS, Wii, Xbox 360 Slim, Switch Lite/OLED (Retired).&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CURRENT COMMAND:&lt;/strong&gt; High-End Gaming Laptop &amp; ROG Ally X Mobile Command.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INFRASTRUCTURE:&lt;/strong&gt; Fully migrated from Cloud (Shadow/GFN) to Dedicated Local Hardware.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-top: 30px; padding: 15px; border: 1px dashed #00ffff; background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;strong style=\"color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;Commander\'s Intent:&lt;/strong&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin: 10px 0; font-size: 14px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            Maintaining a community built on patience and authenticity. As a disabled gamer, my mission is to provide a home for all players—veteran or new—to engage in high-tier tactical play and narrative immersion without judgment.\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3); padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 25px; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 2px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        IDENTIFIERS VERIFIED // [REDACTED]\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;</CODE>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
(23,'Rules','rules','2026-03-27 06:16:58','2026-03-27 23:39:57','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;title&gt;Official Community Rules - HarleyTG&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;style&gt;<br/>\n        @keyframes scanline {<br/>\n            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); }<br/>\n            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.6); border-color: #ffffff; }<br/>\n            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); }<br/>\n        }</p>\n        <br/>\n<i>    </i><CODE>    @keyframes glitch {\n<i>    </i>        0% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5); }\n<i>    </i>        95% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5); }\n<i>    </i>        96% { text-shadow: -2px 0 #ff00ff, 2px 0 #00ffff; }\n<i>    </i>        98% { text-shadow: 2px 0 #ff00ff, -2px 0 #00ffff; }\n<i>    </i>        100% { text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5); }\n<i>    </i>    }\n\n<i>    </i>    .dossier-button {\n<i>    </i>        display: inline-block;\n<i>    </i>        padding: 12px 24px;\n<i>    </i>        border: 1px solid #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>        color: #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>        text-decoration: none;\n<i>    </i>        font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace;\n<i>    </i>        font-size: 14px;\n<i>    </i>        text-transform: uppercase;\n<i>    </i>        background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);\n<i>    </i>        letter-spacing: 2px;\n<i>    </i>        transition: all 0.3s ease;\n<i>    </i>        animation: scanline 3s infinite ease-in-out;\n<i>    </i>        cursor: pointer;\n<i>    </i>    }\n\n<i>    </i>    .dossier-button:hover {\n<i>    </i>        background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n<i>    </i>        box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.9);\n<i>    </i>        transform: translateY(-2px);\n<i>    </i>        text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>        color: #ffffff;\n<i>    </i>    }\n<i>    </i>&lt;/style&gt;</CODE>\n<p>&lt;/head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;body style=\"background-color: #0a0a0a; margin: 0; padding: 20px; font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace; color: #e8e8e8; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n<i>    </i><CODE>&lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>    max-width: 850px;\n<i>    </i>    width: 100%;\n<i>    </i>    background-color: rgba(25, 25, 25, 0.95);\n<i>    </i>    border: 2px solid #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>    padding: 30px;\n<i>    </i>    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\n<i>    </i>    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n<i>    </i>\"&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 12px; color: #00ffff; margin-bottom: 10px; opacity: 0.8;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        EFFECTED: 10/31/24&lt;br&gt;\n<i>    </i>        UPDATED: 10/31/24\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>        text-align: center; \n<i>    </i>        color: #00ffff; \n<i>    </i>        font-size: 32px; \n<i>    </i>        font-weight: bold; \n<i>    </i>        letter-spacing: 4px; \n<i>    </i>        text-transform: uppercase; \n<i>    </i>        margin-bottom: 25px; \n<i>    </i>        animation: glitch 5s infinite;\n<i>    </i>    \"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        HARLEY-THE-GAMER\'S Rules:\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; border-bottom: 2px solid #00ffff; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>            width: 100px; \n<i>    </i>            height: 100px; \n<i>    </i>            background: url(\'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png\') center/cover no-repeat; \n<i>    </i>            border-radius: 50%; \n<i>    </i>            border: 2px solid #00ffff; \n<i>    </i>            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00ffff; \n<i>    </i>            flex-shrink: 0;\n<i>    </i>        \"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;div&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 26px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;Community Directives&lt;/h1&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0; font-size: 14px;\"&gt;LEADERSHIP: &lt;strong style=\"color: #00ffff;\"&gt;HARLEY-THE-GAMER aka HarleyTG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;1. Cheating and Hacking&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.1 Prohibited Activities:&lt;/strong&gt; Cheating, hacking, or exploiting an unfair advantage is strictly forbidden.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.2 Ban Inquiries:&lt;/strong&gt; If you have been banned, contact support for a formal inquiry.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;2. Conduct &amp; Staff&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2.1 No Backseat Moderation:&lt;/strong&gt; Allow admins and moderators to handle issues.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2.2 Inventory Checks:&lt;/strong&gt; Staff may request to view your Minecraft inventory.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;div style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 15px; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #00ffff; background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05); font-style: italic; font-size: 13px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            STRIKE POLICY: Two warnings result in a 1-week quarantine.\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/div&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;3. Respect &amp; Integrity&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3.0 Standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Bullying or harassment is zero-tolerance. Keep builds and names G-rated.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4.0 Streaming:&lt;/strong&gt; No stream sniping. Respect Platform TOS.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;4. Communication&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chat/VC:&lt;/strong&gt; Abusive language results in a mute or ban. No unauthorized external links or server invites.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;5. Commercial Protocol&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"margin-left: 15px;\"&gt;Scamming and DM advertising are strictly forbidden and result in immediate review.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"margin-top: 40px; padding: 20px; border: 1px dashed #00ffff; background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05); margin-bottom: 30px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;Directive Context&lt;/h3&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\"&gt;By participating in community theaters, you agree to these protocols to ensure a safe, tactical environment. This document is subject to change via leadership update.&lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1wY5JNjKFGwscChBkGItnjBWB8QHD4jZgnjib8ab78Bw/edit?tab=t.0\" \n<i>    </i>           target=\"_blank\" \n<i>    </i>           class=\"dossier-button\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>            &amp;gt; ACCESS MASTER RULES DIRECTIVE\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/a&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;div style=\"text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3); padding-top: 15px; font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 2px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        IDENTIFIERS VERIFIED // END OF DIRECTIVE // [REDACTED]\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;</CODE>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p></r>',0,1,0),
