(25,'Domain Help','domain-help','2026-07-23 23:07:10','2026-07-23 23:08:58','<r><p>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;<br/>\n&lt;html lang=\"en\"&gt;<br/>\n&lt;head&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;meta charset=\"UTF-8\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;title&gt;Domain Help - Harley\'s Clan Forum&lt;/title&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/head&gt;<br/>\n&lt;body style=\"background-color: #0a0a0a; margin: 0; padding: 20px; font-family: \'Courier New\', monospace; color: #e8e8e8; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"&gt;</p>\n\n  <p>&lt;div style=\"<br/>\n    max-width: 850px;<br/>\n    width: 100%;<br/>\n    background-color: rgba(25, 25, 25, 0.95);<br/>\n    border: 2px solid #00ffff;<br/>\n    padding: 30px;<br/>\n    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);<br/>\n    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);<br/>\n  \"&gt;</p>\n\n<i>    </i><CODE>&lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>  width: 120px;\n<i>    </i>  height: 120px;\n<i>    </i>  background: url(\'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HarleyTG-O/logo/main/HTG.png\') center/cover no-repeat;\n<i>    </i>  border-radius: 50%;\n<i>    </i>  border: 3px solid #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>  box-shadow: 0 0 15px #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>  margin: 0 auto 20px auto;\n<i>    </i>\"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;div style=\"\n<i>    </i>  text-align: center;\n<i>    </i>  color: #00ffff;\n<i>    </i>  font-size: 32px;\n<i>    </i>  font-weight: bold;\n<i>    </i>  letter-spacing: 4px;\n<i>    </i>  text-transform: uppercase;\n<i>    </i>  margin-bottom: 8px;\n<i>    </i>  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5);\n<i>    </i>\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  Domain Help\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  HARLEY\'S CLAN FORUM &amp;mdash; OFFICIAL LINKS + SUPPORT\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;p style=\"margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.6; border-bottom: 2px solid #00ffff; padding-bottom: 20px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  This page lists the official domains for Harley\'s Clan Forum and the correct support link.\n<i>    </i>  If you see a lookalike site, do not use it.\n<i>    </i>&lt;/p&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    I. Official Domains\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/h3&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>  &lt;table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold; width: 35%;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        FORUM DOMAIN\n<i>    </i>      &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;a href=\"https://forum.harleytg.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff; text-decoration:none;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>          https://forum.harleytg.com\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/a&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/tr&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>    &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        ALT DOMAIN\n<i>    </i>      &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;a href=\"https://harleysclan.freeflaurm.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff; text-decoration:none;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>          https://harleysclan.freeflaurm.com\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/a&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/table&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>  &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0; font-size: 14px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    Do not trust lookalike sites or unofficial links claiming to be Harley’s Clan Forum.\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;h3 style=\"border-left: 4px solid #00ffff; padding-left: 10px; color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    II. Contact / Support\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/h3&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>  &lt;p style=\"margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    If you wanna contact &lt;strong&gt;@HarleyTG&lt;/strong&gt; or other support please visit:\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/p&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>  &lt;table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2); color: #00ffff; font-weight: bold; width: 35%;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        DISCORD SUPPORT\n<i>    </i>      &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>        &lt;a href=\"https://discord.gg/NvT5QMKxDA\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#00ffff; text-decoration:none;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>          https://discord.gg/NvT5QMKxDA\n<i>    </i>        &lt;/a&gt;\n<i>    </i>      &lt;/td&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;/tr&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/table&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>  &lt;p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    Include your forum username and a short description of the issue.\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;h3 style=\"border-left:4px solid #00ffff;padding-left:10px;color:#00ffff;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    III. Safety Notes\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/h3&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>  &lt;ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-left: 10px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;DO&lt;/span&gt; use only the official domains shown above.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;DO&lt;/span&gt; report scams or impersonation if you see them.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;DO NOT&lt;/span&gt; share your password or login details.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>    &lt;li style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;DO NOT&lt;/span&gt; post personal/private information publicly.&lt;/li&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/ul&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;div style=\"margin-top: 30px; padding: 15px; border: 1px dashed #00ffff; background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.05);\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;strong style=\"color: #00ffff; text-transform: uppercase;\"&gt;Quick Copy&lt;/strong&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>    Forum: &lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;forum.harleytg.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;\n<i>    </i>    Alt: &lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;harleysclan.freeflaurm.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;\n<i>    </i>    Discord: &lt;span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"&gt;discord.gg/NvT5QMKxDA&lt;/span&gt;\n<i>    </i>  &lt;/p&gt;\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;\n\n<i>    </i>&lt;div style=\"text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); padding-top: 15px; margin-top: 25px; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 2px;\"&gt;\n<i>    </i>  HARLEY\'S CLAN FORUM // DOMAIN HELP\n<i>    </i>&lt;/div&gt;</CODE>\n\n  <p>&lt;/div&gt;</p>\n\n<p>&lt;/body&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/html&gt;</p>\n</r>',0,1,0);
