(46,125,1,0,'2025-02-18 15:33:07','We’re expanding our **HarleyTG Forum** and looking for dedicated **Admins & Moderators** to help manage and enhance our community! If you’re passionate about gaming, discussions, and keeping things running smoothly, this is your chance to be a part of something bigger.\n\n### **Why Join as an Admin/Mod?**\n\n✅ Maintain a fun, safe, and engaging space\n✅ Take a leadership role in our growing community\n✅ Gain exclusive perks & behind-the-scenes access\n✅ Help shape the future of **HarleyTG Forum**\n\nYour role will involve moderating discussions, assisting members, and ensuring a great experience for everyone. If you\'re interested, apply now!\n\n📌 **Apply Here:** \n\nLet’s keep building an amazing community together! 🚀🎮',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
