(125,55,1,'2025-02-18 15:33:07',1,'comment','<r><p>We’re expanding our <STRONG><s>**</s>HarleyTG Forum<e>**</e></STRONG> and looking for dedicated <STRONG><s>**</s>Admins &amp; Moderators<e>**</e></STRONG> to help manage and enhance our community! If you’re passionate about gaming, discussions, and keeping things running smoothly, this is your chance to be a part of something bigger.</p>\n\n<H3><s>### </s><STRONG><s>**</s>Why Join as an Admin/Mod?<e>**</e></STRONG></H3>\n\n<p>✅ Maintain a fun, safe, and engaging space<br/>\n✅ Take a leadership role in our growing community<br/>\n✅ Gain exclusive perks &amp; behind-the-scenes access<br/>\n✅ Help shape the future of <STRONG><s>**</s>HarleyTG Forum<e>**</e></STRONG></p>\n\n<p>Your role will involve moderating discussions, assisting members, and ensuring a great experience for everyone. If you\'re interested, apply now!</p>\n\n<p>&#128204; <STRONG><s>**</s>Apply Here:<e>**</e></STRONG> <URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/p/16-staff-application\"><s>&lt;</s>https://forum.harleytg.online/p/16-staff-application<e>&gt;</e></URL><br/>\nStaff Rules: <URL url=\"https://forum.harleytg.online/p/15-staff-rules\"><s>&lt;</s>https://forum.harleytg.online/p/15-staff-rules<e>&gt;</e></URL></p>\n\n<p>Let’s keep building an amazing community together! &#128640;&#127918;</p></r>','2025-02-18 15:40:23',1,'2025-12-01 23:57:23',1,'47.177.47.30',0,1,'Windows',NULL,0,NULL,0,0,0),
